# Authentication and Authorization

Authentication Overview
JWT-based authentication
Access token flow
Authorization model
Step 1: Configure JWT Secret
Local Development
python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
export JWT_SECRET_KEY=<generated-key>
Kubernetes Deployment
kubectl create secret generic smarttouch-secrets \
  --from-literal=jwt-secret-key=<generated-key>
Step 2: Create User Accounts
Generate Password Hash
python -c "from passlib.context import CryptContext; print(CryptContext(schemes=['bcrypt']).hash('mypassword'))"
Add User to Store
_USERS["new_user"] = "$2b$12$..."
Step 3: Start the API
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
Step 4: Obtain an Access Token
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/auth/token
Step 5: Verify Authentication
curl http://localhost:8000/devices
